{
  "1": {
    "episodeId": 1,
    "title": "A Kind Girl",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0007791",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "Once upon a time, there was a very kind girl.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "Her name was Ella.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "She lived happily with her father.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "Ella had fine clothes and jewelry.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "She had a big room with a warm, cozy bed.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "And there was always plenty of food.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "One day Ella and her father were walking in town.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "Wonderful smells came from the bakery.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "\"Let's get a treat,\" Father said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "Ella saw a young beggar sitting in the town square.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "\"That poor boy,\" Ella said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "\"Father, can we please get something for him?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "Father smiled warmly.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "\"You are very kind, Ella.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "Father bought some bread.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "Ella gave it to the boy.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "\"Thank you, miss,\" the boy said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "A few days later, Ella saw Father in the garden.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "\"You look happy, Father,\" she said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "Father laughed. \"I have exciting news!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "\"I met a lovely lady,\" Father said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "\"We're going to get married!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "Ella gasped. \"Father, I'm so happy for you!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "A week later Father got married.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "Ella's new stepmother had two daughters.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "The older daughter was tall and thin.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "The younger one was short and plump.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "\"It's nice to meet you!\" Ella said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "The two daughters smiled.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "So did their mother.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "But there was a nasty look in her eyes.",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "2": {
    "episodeId": 2,
    "title": "Sad News",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0007792",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "Ella's father was on a hunting trip.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "One morning Stepmother woke Ella.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "\"Get up, lazy girl,\" she snapped.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "\"I have some news. Your father is dead!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "Ella gasped. Tears filled her eyes.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "\"Oh no!\" she cried in pain.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "\"Father! My poor father . . .\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "After that, nothing was the same.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "Ella was still kind and polite.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "But Stepmother was now mean.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "Stepmother gave fancy dresses to her daughters.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "Ella wore ugly, old rags.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "The stepsisters slept in soft feather beds.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "Ella slept on a hard bed made of straw.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "Gert napped all day long.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "Trudy ate all day long.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "But Stepmother made Ella work.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "She scrubbed, swept, and mopped.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "\"Pretty little Ella,\" Stepmother said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "\"You think you're better than we are.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "You think you're prettier too.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "\"No, I don't!\" Ella said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "\"You're my family now.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "I love all of you.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "\"Ugh.\" Stepmother sneered. \"You're too nice.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "Go and make my lunch!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "And tend the fire again!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "I don't want my daughters to catch a cold.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "Ella liked to sit near the fire.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "She remembered her days with Father.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "\"I miss him so much,\" she thought.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p32",
        "text": "The stepsisters saw Ella by the fire.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p33",
        "text": "Trudy giggled. \"You're covered in ashes!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p34",
        "text": "\"Ella likes ashes and cinders,\" Gert said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p35",
        "text": "\"Let's call her . . . Cinderella!\"",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "3": {
    "episodeId": 3,
    "title": "A Royal Message",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0007793",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "The next morning a trumpet blew loudly.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "\"A royal messenger!\" Stepmother cried.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "Stepmother and her daughters ran outside.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "Cinderella wiped her hands on her apron.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "Then she followed them.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "\"I wonder what the message is,\" she thought.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "A big crowd was outside.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "The royal messenger sat on a horse.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "He held a long piece of paper.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "\"Ahem!\" the messenger said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "\"This is a very important message.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "The prince is hosting a ball.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "All fine ladies in the kingdom are invited.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "\"Ooh!\" several ladies said at once.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "Cinderella's stepsisters clapped with delight.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "\"We're going to the prince's ball!\" Gert cried.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "Trudy's eyes lit up.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "\"This is so exciting!\" she said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "\"Maybe the prince will ask me to marry him!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "Gert snorted. \"No way, Trudy.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "The prince will fall in love with me!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "I'm beautiful and tall.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "Trudy put her hands on her hips.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "\"Well, I'm beautiful and . . . plump!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "\"Girls, girls,\" Stepmother said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "\"You're both beautiful.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "\"A ball,\" Cinderella said softly.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "\"There will be music and dancing.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "It will be so much fun.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "\"Ha-ha! Cinderella!\" Stepmother laughed loudly.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "\"You're not going to the ball.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p32",
        "text": "You are not a fine lady!\"",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "4": {
    "episodeId": 4,
    "title": "Getting Ready for the Ball",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0007794",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "The stepsisters kept talking about the ball.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "\"I will wear my favorite jewels,\" Gert said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "\"I'm going to dance with the prince,\" Trudy said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "\"Hmph!\" Gert said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "\"The prince won't dance with you.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "He'll be too busy dancing with me!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "\"Girls, girls,\" Stepmother said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "\"The prince will dance with both of you.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "\"How do you know?\" Trudy asked.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "Stepmother had a wicked grin.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "\"The prince is looking for a wife.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "So he will dance with all the ladies.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "Trudy and Gert clapped with delight.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "\"You both must impress him,\" Stepmother said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "\"Then he'll want to marry one of you.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "And I can move to the palace!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "Later Stepmother found Cinderella.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "\"You must make pretty gowns for my daughters.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "Everything must be perfect!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "Cinderella made two beautiful gowns.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "The stepsisters put them on.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "\"I look lovely!\" Trudy said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "\"I look lovely too!\" Gert said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "Trudy looked at Cinderella.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "\"Poor Cinderella,\" she whispered.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "\"You will miss the ball.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "Stepmother spun around. \"Hush, Trudy!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "Cinderella has work to do!\" she yelled.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "\"She will stay home and scrub floors.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "At last it was the night of the ball.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "\"Good-bye, Cinderella!\" the stepsisters called.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p32",
        "text": "Tears slipped from Cinderella's eyes.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p33",
        "text": "She began to sob.",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "5": {
    "episodeId": 5,
    "title": "A Visitor",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0007795",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "Cinderella felt awful.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "Her stepsisters were at the fancy ball.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "But she was home alone.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "\"I wish I could go to the ball.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "Cinderella wiped away her tears.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "\"I must not feel sorry for myself,\" she said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "\"I have lots of work to do.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "Cinderella got a rag and a bucket.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "She got down on her hands and knees.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "And she began to scrub.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "Cinderella heard something.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "\"What was that?\" she thought.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "She went outside.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "There was a small woman at the fountain.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "She had sparkling wings.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "\"Oops,\" she said. \"I'm all wet!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "Cinderella gasped. \"W-who are you?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "\"I'm your fairy godmother,\" the woman said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "She stood up and flapped her wings.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "The fairy flew over to Cinderella.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "\"I'm here to check on you,\" she said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "\"I wanted to make sure you're okay.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "Cinderella stared in surprise.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "Suddenly she burst into tears.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "\"My dear!\" the fairy said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "\"What's wrong? Tell me!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "\"I'm not okay,\" Cinderella said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "\"My life is terrible!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "I work and work and work.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "And tonight . . .\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "\"You want to go to the ball,\" the fairy said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p32",
        "text": "Cinderella sniffed. \"Yes, but—\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p33",
        "text": "The fairy smiled brightly. \"Then you will go!\"",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "6": {
    "episodeId": 6,
    "title": "A Wish Comes True",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0007796",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "Cinderella stared at her fairy godmother.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "\"Really? I can go to the ball?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "Godmother nodded. \"Yes.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "Run to the garden and bring me a pumpkin.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "\"A pumpkin?\" Cinderella went to the garden.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "She found a nice pumpkin and ran back.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "\"Here!\" Cinderella set the pumpkin in front of Godmother.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "Godmother tapped it with her wand. Zap!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "The pumpkin was now a golden coach!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "\"Next we need some horses,\" Godmother said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "\"I'll find some mice!\" Cinderella said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "Godmother counted. \"One. Two. Three. Four.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "Zap! The mice turned into a team of horses.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "\"Hmm.\" Godmother looked around.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "\"Who will drive the golden coach?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "\"There are rats in the cellar,\" Cinderella said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "\"Perfect!\" Godmother replied.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "\"Bring me one!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "Zap!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "Soon a jolly driver with whiskers stood there.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "Zap! Zap!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "Two lizards became handsome servants.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "Godmother smiled. \"Your coach is ready, my dear!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "\"But . . .\" Cinderella pointed at her clothes.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "The fairy touched her lightly with the wand.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "Zap!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "Cinderella's ugly rags were gone.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "Now she wore a beautiful gown with sparkling jewels.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "And on her feet . . .",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "Cinderella wore the prettiest glass shoes in the world!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "She climbed into the coach.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p32",
        "text": "\"Good-bye, Godmother! I'm off to the ball!\"",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "7": {
    "episodeId": 7,
    "title": "The Princess Arrives",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0007797",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "The golden coach started down the road.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "\"Wait!\" Godmother called.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "The coach stopped.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "Cinderella looked back. \"What is it?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "\"You must obey one rule tonight,\" Godmother said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "\"You must leave the ball by midnight or . . .\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "\"Yes?\" Cinderella asked.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "\"Poof!\" Godmother said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "\"Your golden coach will disappear.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "Your clothes will turn back into rags.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "Cinderella nodded. \"I promise, Godmother.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "I will leave the ball by midnight.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "The horses took off again.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "\"Thank you!\" Cinderella called.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "At the ball the prince danced with many fine ladies.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "One fine lady talked too much.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "One fine lady danced too fast.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "One fine lady stepped on his toes.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "\"This is boring,\" the prince thought.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "He went outside and sighed.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "There were many fine ladies at the ball.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "But he didn't want to marry any of them.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "Just then the prince spotted something.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "A golden coach was coming.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "\"Who's that?\" he said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "\"It looks like a beautiful princess!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "The golden coach arrived at the palace.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "Cinderella saw a handsome young man.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "\"The prince!\" she whispered.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "The prince rushed down the steps.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "\"Hello,\" he said softly.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p32",
        "text": "He bowed and took Cinderella's hand.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p33",
        "text": "The prince and Cinderella entered the ballroom.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p34",
        "text": "Everyone hushed.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p35",
        "text": "\"Who is that?\" they whispered.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p36",
        "text": "\"Who is that beautiful princess?\"",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "8": {
    "episodeId": 8,
    "title": "The Ball",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0007798",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "Cinderella danced with the prince.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "The king and queen watched them.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "\"What a beautiful princess!\" they said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "The fine ladies stared too.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "\"Who made the princess' gown?\" they asked.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "\"I want one!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "\"Me too!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "Then Cinderella sat down with the prince.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "Servants brought out trays of food.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "The prince didn't eat a thing.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "He just stared at Cinderella.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "Cinderella spotted her stepsisters.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "She smiled at the prince. \"I'll be right back.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "Cinderella brought some treats to her stepsisters.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "They thanked her and each gave a curtsy.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "Cinderella giggled quietly.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "They thought she was a real princess!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "The prince and Cinderella began to dance again.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "Before midnight Cinderella stopped.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "\"I must go,\" she said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "\"Oh,\" the prince said sadly.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "\"I'm having another ball tomorrow.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "Will you come?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "\"I will try,\" Cinderella said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "At home, Godmother was waiting by the fire.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "\"Oh, Godmother!\" Cinderella said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "\"I had a wonderful time at the ball.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "The prince is so handsome!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "Soon Cinderella's stepsisters came home.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "Cinderella yawned and stretched.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "She acted sleepy.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p32",
        "text": "\"How was the ball?\" she asked.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p33",
        "text": "Trudy frowned. \"It was terrible.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p34",
        "text": "\"Some dumb princess showed up,\" Gert said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p35",
        "text": "\"After that the prince ignored us!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p36",
        "text": "Cinderella fell asleep with a smile.",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "9": {
    "episodeId": 9,
    "title": "Singing Softly",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0007799",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "The next morning Cinderella started her chores.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "Stepmother barked orders at her.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "But it didn't bother Cinderella today.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "\"Last night was lovely,\" she thought.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "\"I wish every night was that wonderful.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "Cinderella hummed as she swept the floor.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "\"Quiet down!\" Stepmother snapped.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "\"You're giving me a headache!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "\"Yes, Stepmother,\" Cinderella said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "Cinderella worked quietly.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "But in her head, she was still singing.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "\"Grr . . .\" Stepmother stomped around the room.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "\"Why did that princess appear at the ball last night?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "\"She ruined everything,\" Trudy said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "\"The prince never noticed me.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "\"The prince didn't notice me either,\" Gert said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "\"I must wear more jewels tonight.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "Stepmother frowned.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "\"Tonight you both must look your best!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "Trudy and Gert spent all afternoon getting ready.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "Finally they left for the ball.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "Cinderella felt sad—then Godmother appeared!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "\"Ready to go to another ball, Ella?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "\"Yes!\" Cinderella cried.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "Her godmother waved her wand. Zap!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "Once again Cinderella wore the glass shoes.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "But tonight she had a different gown.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "All night long Cinderella danced with the prince.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "\"You look even more beautiful tonight,\" he said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "Cinderella closed her eyes.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "\"I never want to leave,\" she whispered.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p32",
        "text": "Bong! Bong! Bong!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p33",
        "text": "Just then the clock struck—12 o'clock!",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "10": {
    "episodeId": 10,
    "title": "Midnight!",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0007800",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "Cinderella dropped the prince's hand.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "She ran outside as the clock struck 12.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "\"Wait!\" the prince shouted. \"Don't go!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "Cinderella started down the steps.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "One of her glass shoes fell off.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "Cinderella looked back.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "But it was too late to get the shoe.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "Her golden coach was already a pumpkin.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "Her beautiful gown was an ugly old rag again.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "The prince ran down the steps.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "\"Where is the princess?\" he cried.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "He ran past Cinderella.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "Cinderella's heart sank.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "He didn't know that she was the princess!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "Slowly she began to walk home.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "The prince went back up the steps.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "Near the top step, something sparkled.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "\"Hmm,\" the prince said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "He picked it up. \"What's this?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "Cinderella got home.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "She was tired and cold.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "She added a log to the fire.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "Later the stepsisters came home.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "\"How was the ball?\" Cinderella asked.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "\"Was the beautiful princess there again?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "\"Yes.\" Gert made a face.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "\"She left at midnight.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "But the prince kept talking about her.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "He even found something of hers.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "Cinderella leaned forward. \"What did he find?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "\"A glass shoe,\" Trudy said. \"It's really pretty.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p32",
        "text": "\"Cinderella!\" Stepmother snapped.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p33",
        "text": "\"Get our beds ready!\"",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "11": {
    "episodeId": 11,
    "title": "The Glass Shoe",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0007801",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "In the morning Cinderella listened to the stepsisters.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "They were still talking about the prince.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "\"He's in love with that princess,\" Trudy said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "\"He's going to look for her!\" Gert said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "Cinderella brushed away some tears.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "\"The prince will never find me,\" she thought.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "Later the king's messenger came to town.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "He blew his trumpet.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "Stepmother and the stepsisters ran outside.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "Cinderella followed them.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "\"Hear this, ladies!\" the messenger said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "\"The prince found a glass shoe.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "Every fine lady must try it on.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "The prince will marry whoever it fits.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "Gert grinned. \"Maybe the shoe will fit me!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "\"Or me!\" Trudy said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "Stepmother glared at them.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "\"It will fit one of you!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "The messenger visited every home in town.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "Every lady tried on the glass shoe.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "But it didn't fit anyone.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "At last the messenger reached Cinderella's house.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "Cinderella was sweeping.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "First, Gert sat down. \"Er . . . grr . . .\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "She tried to push her foot into the shoe.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "But it didn't fit.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "\"Get up, Gert,\" Stepmother said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "\"Now it's Trudy's turn.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "Trudy tried to push her foot into the shoe.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "\"It doesn't fit,\" she said sadly.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "Cinderella dropped her broom.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p32",
        "text": "\"What about me?\" she asked.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p33",
        "text": "\"May I try on the shoe?\"",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  }
}
